meta {
  name: Get Profile (blocked client)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{client_token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Get Profile — blocked client

  When the admin blocks a client, existing tokens are revoked and
  `ensure.client` rejects further API calls with **403**.

  ```json
  { "message": "Учётная запись клиента заблокирована" }
  ```

  Use a token issued **before** block only if it was not revoked yet;
  after `clients.toggle-block` all `mobile-client` tokens are deleted.
}
